* text=auto eol=lf
# merge=union: append-only hook-written logs — timestamped, self-contained lines; multi-branch
# appends structurally conflict on every rebase/merge, and union concatenates both sides losing
# nothing, i.e. the attribute states the files' actual semantics (an unordered append set).
# Consumers read fields/timestamps, never line position; a consumer that starts depending on
# line order is the bug (retired ADR 0077; gate-hits line: ADR 0080).
docs/pdca/session-log.txt merge=union
docs/pdca/gate-hits.txt merge=union
